WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:02.100
Now the instructor.

2
00:00:02.400 --> 00:00:05.100
First, read the label and choose.

3
00:00:05.400 --> 00:00:07.000
Then PASS.

4
00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:11.600
Pull the pin.

5
00:00:11.900 --> 00:00:15.500
Aim low, at the base of the fire.

6
00:00:15.800 --> 00:00:17.400
Squeeze the handle.

7
00:00:17.700 --> 00:00:19.500
Sweep side to side.

8
00:00:22.500 --> 00:00:33.000
The instructor shows the right operating distance for that extinguisher - and when to stop and back away, even if it isn't empty.

9
00:00:33.300 --> 00:00:36.900
When it's out, back away facing the fire.

